      "message": "Just took another look at this patch - AFAICT, this method is used in the NetworkRequest path, but TransportInfo is not a requestable field, so this is almost certainly going to be empty.\n\nI\u0027ll be honest though, I can\u0027t think of many other good options, especially with an aim to be able to use this back to T:\n  - WifiNetworkSpecifier doesn\u0027t yet support subId matching\n  - NetworkRequest#setSubscriptionIds is SystemApi, and we\u0027d have to teach Wifi to advertise SubId capabilities for the NetworkOffer",
